---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Request an enterprise quotation" description="Scope a Smart Exam proposal around your deployment, examination workflow, integrations and support requirements."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-title-only"><span class="eyebrow">Request a quote</span><h1>A proposal built around the scope.</h1><p class="intro">Share your examination program and operating requirements. Licensing, implementation, integrations and support are agreed in a tailored proposal.</p></div></section><section class="form-section"><div class="container form-layout"><aside class="form-aside"><h2>Bring the right information.</h2><p>A useful proposal starts with your candidate volumes, concurrent peak, examination duration, department model, recording needs, infrastructure and support expectations.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><strong>Clear inclusions</strong><p>Software scope, implementation milestones and acceptance criteria.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Visible dependencies</strong><p>Infrastructure, provider services, integrations and operating responsibilities.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Agreed terms</strong><p>License duration, support, change control and rollout decisions.</p></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/licensing/" style="margin-top:25px">Explore licensing</a></aside><LeadForm kind="quote" buttonLabel="Request a scoped quotation" /></div></section></Base>
